{"tmdb":1306816,"tagline":"My daughter is a zombie. The last remaining zombie in the world.","synopsis":"Jung-hwan is a gruff but loving zookeeper who specializes in training wild beasts. His teenage daughter, Soo-ah, is going through puberty and a full-blown dance obsession. Their days are full of bickering and bonding... until one day, Soo-ah becomes infected by a zombie virus that has swept across the globe. Refusing to give up on his daughter, Jung-hwan takes her to a quiet seaside village called Eunbong-ri, where his mother Bam-soon lives. In a world obsessed with rooting out the infected, Soo-ah shows strange signs of awareness - responding to music, her grandmother's sharp taps with a back scratcher, and even faint traces of human language. Determined to protect her at all costs, Jung-hwan draws on his years of experience training tigers and begins a secret mission to tame and retrain... his zombie daughter.","directors":[{"name":"Pil Gam-seong","id":2313022}],"cast":[{"actor":"Cho Jung-seok","role":"Lee Jung-hwan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pVZHsNj31fNMyWixqg26TA9HjU1.jpg","tmdb":1223316},{"actor":"Lee Jung-eun","role":"Kim Bam-soon","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4r3K47UpSmzZ5t9cyTRRqRl9rdz.jpg","tmdb":1572354},{"actor":"Cho Yeo-jeong","role":"Shin Yeon-hwa","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5MgWM8pkUiYkj9MEaEpO0Ir1FD9.jpg","tmdb":556435},{"actor":"Yoon Kyung-ho","role":"Cho Dong-bae","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/217cVZqyvJypi4OR1uvxoaJxvLm.jpg","tmdb":560081},{"actor":"Choi Yu-ri","role":"Lee Soo-ah","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dUp7EAnZzKVX6JSMbLQgpeD9r9W.jpg","tmdb":2151474},{"actor":"Geumdong-i","role":"Meowmeow","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/amjD8hZH1h8JyJpEqEa73sbGVUW.jpg","tmdb":5614216},{"actor":"Jeon Su-ji","role":"Lee Jeong-hye","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rq3IzuuQk0j9FgbHNvbpkrwm9m4.jpg","tmdb":1190567},{"actor":"Kim Beong-choun","role":"Village Chief","photo":"https:/